| **Dec 10** | MEL → AKL → WLG (Air New Zealand)      | 1 (Auckland) | 7 h 30 m | **$250 – $300** | Air New Zealand |
| **Dec 20** (fallback) | MEL → AKL → WLG (Air New Zealand) | 1 (Auckland) | 7 h 30 m | **$260 – $320** | Air New Zealand |

